    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it doesn't feel like \"quiet making.\" it feels like being a ghost. i'm just going through the motions of a life that doesn't belong to me anymore. the world keeps moving and expects something from me, but there's nothing left to give. it feels like i'm just occupying space until something happens.",
