      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't think there's a \"next version\" of me. that's the thing. i've used it all up. i look at the future and it's just... more of this. more pretending to be a person when the essence is gone. it feels more like a finished story than a holding pattern. like the book is done and i'm just staring at the blank pages at the end.",
